          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.354,
            0.573,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Lenses are important and are used everywhere around us. The eyeglasses that people wear to help them see clearly"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.604,
            0.367,
            0.879,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fig. 10.19: Converging sunlight on paper using a convex lens"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.409,
            0.492,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "are lenses (Fig. 10.20a). Cameras (Fig. 10.20b), telescopes, and microscopes all use lenses to work. Even our eye has a convex lens inside it. It is quite an amazing lens that can change its shape, which is what allows us to read a book or see something far away."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
